# Re-record from the repo root after `npm run build`: vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 680
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "npm run demo --silent"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 9s
